# Byte-identical checkouts on every OS: the dev loop rsyncs the working tree to
# Linux (see WINDOWS_DEV.md) and byte-sensitive tests read fixtures straight
# from the tree, so CRLF worktree files break the devbox gate. `text=auto`
# lets git detect binaries (never touched); `eol=lf` forces LF for text, in
# blobs and checkouts, with no per-OS conversion ever.
* text=auto eol=lf
